  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">As one of cloud computing service categories, desktop as a service (DaaS) provides cloud service customers with desktop functions remotely delivered by cloud service providers. Recommendation ITU-T Y.3503 introduces the concept of DaaS, and describes general and functional requirements. To derive those requirements relevant use cases are also presented.</abstract>
